Package: midisynth
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: MIDI synthesiser keyboard for V\OS
 MidiSynth is an on-screen MIDI keyboard that plays through the system
 synthesiser: pick a SoundFont, play with the mouse or a computer
 keyboard, transpose and remap keys, follow chords, and watch the
 oscilloscope. MIDI goes out through the V\OS MIDI kit, so external
 ports work alongside the internal synth.
